contentBody:
What does this code display?

```python
marks = 63
if marks >= 75:
    print("Distinction")
elif marks >= 40:
    print("Pass")
else:
    print("Fail")
```

Which statements are true about this code?

```python
marks = 80
if marks >= 40:
    print("Pass")
elif marks >= 75:
    print("Distinction")
else:
    print("Fail")
```
